nodes.body:
@hnyls2002 @Qiaolin-Yu Could you help enable CI and review this PR?

The GPU end-to-end throughput results are included in the PR description. The latest follow-up preserves bucketed draft-weight updates, refreshes candidate caches after online updates, and adds one focused CPU regression in an existing test file. Stale references to removed tests have also been cleaned up.

The current test workflows stop at the missing `run-ci` label gate. Could you add `run-ci` (and `run-ci-extra` if appropriate) and rerun CI? Thank you.

